# Yellow mob (YellowMob, 2026-11-21): native 48x32 frames, facing right, feet on row 31. A hunched, skull-masked charger:
# a yellowed bone mask M with a pale brow B, horns and two ember eyes e in shadow sockets n, a hide mantle in oxblood F with
# rust lights R and shade f, leather wraps and loincloth l/L. Boxes (YellowMob.java, unchanged): every live frame is drawn
# within x 7..24, y 5..31, a pixel inside the body hitbox rect(6, 4, 20, 28) (D10), and reaches x 10 and x 23 and row 6, so
# the hurtbox rect(10, 6, 14, 26) never lies past the drawing. Exported by tools/enemy_sprites.py into
# assets/images/enemy/yellow_mob.png in the cells YellowMob.java reads (sprite_layouts.ENEMY_SHEETS).
# idle1..4: the hunched stance, the shoulders heaving; run1..4: stride, pass, stride, pass (a pixel lower on the strides);
# hit, flash, knees, down: the death (the mask knocked back with the eyes white, a white flash, then falling, the knees buckled and the body
# half down and tipping forward, then face down
# with the whole skull mask, standing size, fallen on its side, horns along the ground and the sockets dark).
# Danger family: oxblood 5e2218 and rust 8e3420 (hue 30 to 35, low chroma) lie apart from the red mob's wine and scarlet and
# the bugs' crimson; the yellowed bone mask b0a474 is greyer than the hero's skin e6a86c. The moon rim (D92) lights the ink
# contour on export.
size 48 32
color k 0b0814
color f 2e1a16
color F 5e2218
color R 8e3420
color m 74684a
color M b0a474
color B d4ccaa
color n 140c14
color e ff6b57
color l 3a2a24
color L 6a5040
color W ffffff
